{"code": 1, "data": {"content": "<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14px;\">[收录于&nbsp; <a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"/news/2558/content00896?type=0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><em><strong>#<span style=\"color: #c91623; text-decoration: underline;\">一体化</span>供应链-标准解决方案</strong></em></span></a> 合集]</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">行业痛点与方案</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #c91623;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">行业痛点</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><em><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"background-color: #c91623;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;1 </span></strong></span></span></em><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span><em><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">自动化项目客户现场10+种设备分散监控</span></em></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><br /><em><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"background-color: #c91623;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;2 <span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></strong></span>自动化项目客户现场10+设备厂商分散监控</span></em></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><br /><em><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"background-color: #c91623;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;3 <span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></strong></span>自动化项目设备厂商多提供2D监控、报表类监控</span></em></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #2576e8;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">解决方案</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff; background-color: #2576e8;\">&nbsp;1 <span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></span>聚合10+种高保真设备三维模型进行一站式监控</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><br /><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff; background-color: #2576e8;\">&nbsp;2 <span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></span>通过京东物控实时采集设备运行数据，支持近28种主流自动化设备的标准对接及交付</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><br /><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff; background-color: #2576e8;\">&nbsp;3 <span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></span>采用自研3D建模技术构建出1:1还原实际生产场景的二维可视化监控，且支持从大屏到PC到移动端多平台操作</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><br /><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">解决方案</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #2576e8;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">智能仓3D可视化解决方案</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">基于京东物流科技多年智能仓领域丰富经验，团队自主研发3D引擎，拥有55+高质量，高精度的智能仓三维模型资源；参考客户现场复杂、不标准、不直观、不可视的监控场景系统担任智能仓储&ldquo;管家&rdquo;角色，通过对仓储监控流程的标准化定义，实现对仓内大型自动化设备数据、物联网终端数据、企业信息系统数据等的实时采集、展示、分析以及决策。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/122934/27/34743/168941/63ec7cbcFf9719584/e5655b48e34cfe79.jpg\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><br /><span style=\"color: #2576e8;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">智能园区3D可视化解决方案</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">针对园区复杂人车场场景管理，支持从人到仓到车到能源能耗的全场景3D可视化监控，此外凭借<span style=\"color: #c91623;\"><a style=\"color: #c91623;\" href=\"/materialControl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">京东物控</a></span>云部署能力支持园区多仓同平台统一监控，解决单仓信息孤岛现象升管理运营效率。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/30737/33/20357/142871/63ec7cc7F4c73bf8f/b2e77750e3d18dac.jpg\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #2576e8;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">针对中小企业客户3D可视化解决方案</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">基于物控平台产套标准化应用服务，针对中小型有自动化信息化、数字化升级诉求预算较低的客户，提供3D编辑器支持简易式&ldquo;拖拉拽&rdquo;搭建场景一键发布即运行的代运营服务性价比优越。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/190066/38/31870/154671/63ec7ccfF388ba718/ec08ec9979ba31c3.jpg\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><br /><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">成功案例</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">某智能厨卫制造头部客户</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">在智能厨卫制造行业利用3D可视化技术实现双自动化库区30000多储位、1000多台设备的3D全场景重现与监控，采用&ldquo;设备报警&rdquo;、&ldquo;资源报警&rdquo;等多种报警机制监控仓储作业全域异常，实现场景货、物状态直观可视、设备和物流动线逼真模拟，一屏掌握全局，以简驭繁，提升客户运营效率。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/125023/21/28754/214615/63ec7cd8Fef735b0a/ab8a441cea6dfe89.jpg\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/188716/40/32340/43354/63f2dab1Fe68f5b42/bf7ec95adb56abae.png\" /></p>", "contentAbstract": "", "contentCode": "content01050", "contentTitle": "软件产品-京东物控 3D SCADA", "contentType": 2, "createTime": 1676426136000, "id": 2846, "isDelete": 0, "link": "", "linkType": 0, "projectName": "京东物流官网", "srcUrl": "/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/65080/31/24827/12263/63ef4da0F513f539b/da6426ba13478e89.png", "updateTime": 1677114993000}}